# ---- PURPLE! shout and Doctor Ammonius
shout.lucifertotem.ammonius=Doctor Ammonius (from somewhere): %s
shout.lucifertotem.alt.1=It's the purple, baby!
shout.lucifertotem.alt.2=Read the Greek!
shout.lucifertotem.alt.3=That is the theriac!
shout.lucifertotem.alt.4=Medicine, my friend. Ancient medicine.
shout.lucifertotem.alt.5=Oh gawd... PURPLE!
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius_says=<Doctor Ammonius> %s
chat.lucifertotem.pythia_says=<The Pythia> %s
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.whack=Read a book! *whack*
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.price=Three emeralds for a Theriac. Scholarship is not free.
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.sold=One theriac! Drink it near me, I want to see.
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.sibyl=There. The Sibyl's leaves. Don't read them in the wind.
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.pythia=Want the real oracle? %s
chat.lucifertotem.ammonius.no_pythia=The Pythia? Not around here. Nobody reads anymore.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.1=Nobody reads the Greek! It's all right there in the Greek!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.2=Pharmakon means drug AND remedy AND poison. Context, people!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.3=The Medusae are real. I've seen them. In the sea. Purple.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.4=Theriac: seventy ingredients, one antidote. Emperors drank it daily.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.5=Mithridates took a little venom every day. Nobody could poison him!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.6=Pull a mandrake facing west, after three circles with a sword. Theophrastus said so!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.7=The Pythia breathed the vapours, and THEN she spoke. Obviously!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.8=Trophonius! Go down into the dark and you never laugh again. Fantastic.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.9=Those Thessalian witches pull the stars down. It's in the texts!
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.10=Purple dye was worth more than gold. Think about that. PURPLE.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.11=Medea knew her pharmacology. That cauldron? Real chemistry.
rant.lucifertotem.ammonius.12=The Gorgon's blood: left vein kills, right vein heals. Asclepius!
gloss.lucifertotem.1=Lexicon: "pharmakeia" - the craft of drugs, the art of the witch.
gloss.lucifertotem.2=Lexicon: "theriake" - from "therion", a wild beast. A cure for its bite.
gloss.lucifertotem.3=Lexicon: "dipsas" - the thirst-snake. One bite and you can never drink enough.
gloss.lucifertotem.4=Lexicon: "pneuma" - breath, vapour, spirit. What rises from the vent at Delphi.
gloss.lucifertotem.5=Lexicon: "mandragoras" - the mandrake. Scream included.
gloss.lucifertotem.6=Lexicon: "hyoskyamos" - henbane, the hog-bean. Visions, then regret.
gloss.lucifertotem.7=Lexicon: "porphyra" - purple. The colour of kings, from a sea snail.
gloss.lucifertotem.8=Lexicon: "sibylla" - the prophetess. Her leaves blow away if you're careless.
gloss.lucifertotem.9=Lexicon: "gorgo" - the grim one. Don't look her in the eye.
gloss.lucifertotem.10=Lexicon: "mithridateion" - the antidote of a king who could not be poisoned.

