pythia.lucifertotem.silent=...she sits silent. Breathe the vapour first.
pythia.lucifertotem.gift=...she waits for a gift. A laurel, perhaps.
pythia.lucifertotem.tired=...the vapours are thin. Come back in a little while.
pythia.lucifertotem.open.1=Hear me, wanderer, and do not ask twice.
pythia.lucifertotem.open.2=The laurel burns; the tripod speaks.
pythia.lucifertotem.open.3=I count the grains of sand and measure the sea...
pythia.lucifertotem.open.4=The god speaks through me. Listen.
pythia.lucifertotem.close.1=So it is spoken.
