# 1.3.0 guest-podcast clips: one subtitle per clip (the spoken swear is starred)
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.are_you_the_god_pan=Ammonius: "Yelling at me, are you the God Pan? He just kept repeating it over and over again."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.athenian_assembly_cannabis=Ammonius: "Did you know the Athenian assembly burnt cannabis?"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.bar_bar_bar=Ammonius: "Bar bar bar bar bar. That's how they talk."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.black_death_are_you_ready=Ammonius: "Okay. Okay, black death. Are you ready? Take your opium."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.castoreum_beaver=Ammonius: "They called it castoreum in antiquity. It was very valuable."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.christ_is_a_drug_term=Ammonius: "It's a drug term. A Christ. Yeah, it's a drug term."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.communion_meaningless=Ammonius: "Bishop, I'm looking at you in the eyes. Your communion is meaningless."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.dark_star_lucifera=Ammonius: "We're gonna shoot you across the dark star and we're gonna use the morning star to guide you. Isn't that nice, Lucifera?"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.devil_doesnt_let_me=Ammonius: "Devil doesn't let me, right? It's part of the contract."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.dont_buy_my_book=Ammonius: "Don't buy my book Chemical Muse because it's like six hundred dollars."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.forget_those_sumerians=Ammonius: "No, no. F*** those Sumerians! Oh, I'm sorry!"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.freeze_you_in_your_tracks=Ammonius: "You can't touch me if I've got an arrow with poison on it. You can't get close to me, I'm gonna freeze you right in your tracks."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.galen_fifty_to_sixty_drugs=Ammonius: "They're talking about compounds made of 50 to 60 drugs"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.galene_calm_of_the_storm=Ammonius: "He says it's the calm of the storm"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.get_you_psychotic=Ammonius: "That one will get you psychotic. Don't you love that one?"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.gilgamesh_bonehead=Ammonius: "Have you ever read Gilgamesh, Bonehead? Have you ever read it?"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.greed_stains_your_soul=Ammonius: "Greed stains your soul with a stench of ruin."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.ios_arrow_poison=Ammonius: "The ios is the arrow poison."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.julian_destroy_education=Ammonius: "Christianity will destroy your education, and when they destroy your education, they will control your government."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.kitchen_horse_whip=Ammonius: "There is no way that this man is a classicist and giving out Greek from his kitchen with a horse whip."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.medea_built_euphrates=Ammonius: "Holy mackerel did you see what Medea built under the under the Euphrates"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.medea_napalm=Ammonius: "Medea comes up with basically a napalm"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.medea_root_for_medicine=Ammonius: "Right? The name Medea is our root for medicine"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.medea_unheralded_genius=Ammonius: "Medea is the unheralded genius of the Bronze Age."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.mr_rogers_greek=Ammonius: "It's kind of like Mr. Rogers, but using Greek"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.museum_alexandria=Ammonius: "The museum in Alexandria was a place where you could build science"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.never_seen_so_many_drugs=Ammonius: "Oh my God, generally, I've never seen so many drugs."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.opium_dosage_upwards=Ammonius: "His only complaint is that he has to keep adjusting his opium dosage upwards."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.poopy_languages=Ammonius: "There's some poopy languages in Italy."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.slaves_and_priests=Ammonius: "There's two classes of people who are branded that way in antiquity, slaves and priests."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.smoking_the_scorpion=Ammonius: "Smoking the scorpion is a spiral down into the abyss, man."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.third_grader=Ammonius: "You would wonder why it reads like it was written by a third grader"
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.vatican_hill_sibyl=Ammonius: "The Vatican Hill didn't have a pope on it. The Vatican Hill had a sibyl on it."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.victorian_bastards=Ammonius: "The last generation that did that was your ancestors, those Victorian bastards."
subtitles.lucifertotem.ammonius.line.where_can_i_join=Ammonius: "They've made people into drug dispensaries. Where can I join? I really want to join this"
