lyric.lucifertotem.1=Up from the islands where the dusk never ends,
lyric.lucifertotem.2=we tune our lyres and we call up our friends:
lyric.lucifertotem.3=a goat on the drums and a star for a light,
lyric.lucifertotem.4=we are Devil's Flight, we are Devil's Flight!
lyric.lucifertotem.5=The purple is burning, the vinegar's aged,
lyric.lucifertotem.6=the Doctor is lecturing, so get on the stage!
interview.lucifertotem.greet=<Lucifer> The Morning Star gives interviews to anyone who climbs this high. Ask.
interview.lucifertotem.click=Click to ask
interview.lucifertotem.locked=(a question you have not earned yet: %s)
interview.lucifertotem.far=Lucifer is too far away to hear the question.
interview.lucifertotem.not_yet=<Lucifer> Not yet. Come back when you've been there.
interview.lucifertotem.you=You: %s
interview.lucifertotem.says=<Lucifer> %s
interview.lucifertotem.q.who=Who are you?
interview.lucifertotem.a.who.1=The one who rises before the sun and is gone when it comes up. Some call that a fall.
interview.lucifertotem.a.who.2=I just call it being early.
interview.lucifertotem.q.place=What is the Lightfall?
interview.lucifertotem.a.place.1=A sky where it is always dusk, so the morning star never has to set.
interview.lucifertotem.a.place.2=I made it for the people who love the hour just before the lamps go on.
interview.lucifertotem.q.totem=Why does my Totem whisper?
interview.lucifertotem.a.totem.1=Everything that carries a light ends up talking to whoever holds it.
interview.lucifertotem.a.totem.2=Listen to it. It knows the way, and it is usually right.
interview.lucifertotem.q.purple=What is it with the purple?
interview.lucifertotem.a.purple.1=Ten thousand snails go into one emperor's robe, and the emperor thinks the color is his.
interview.lucifertotem.a.purple.2=It belongs to the snails. Ask the Doctor. He'll tell you for an hour.
interview.lucifertotem.q.ammonius=What do you make of Doctor Ammonius?
interview.lucifertotem.a.ammonius.1=Imagine a man who reads the footnotes and then gets angry at the whole main text.
interview.lucifertotem.a.ammonius.2=I like him. He never ends a lecture without saying hello to me.
interview.lucifertotem.q.graduate=Is my Ammon U diploma real?
interview.lucifertotem.a.graduate.1=As real as anyone else's. It's paper and a seal and somebody's confidence.
interview.lucifertotem.a.graduate.2=Wear the cap. It suits you better than a crown would.
interview.lucifertotem.q.hekate=Who is Hekate to you?
interview.lucifertotem.a.hekate.1=She keeps the crossroads and I keep the dawn. We each hold a torch.
interview.lucifertotem.a.hekate.2=Don't lose her key. Her dogs remember faces.
interview.lucifertotem.q.mysteries=What did I see at Eleusis?
interview.lucifertotem.a.mysteries.1=You know I can't answer that, and neither can you. That's what makes it a mystery.
interview.lucifertotem.a.mysteries.2=I'll only say there was wheat, and that it was enough.
interview.lucifertotem.q.band=Do you like Devil's Flight?
interview.lucifertotem.a.band.1=That goat keeps better time than the stars do.
interview.lucifertotem.a.band.2=I've asked them to play at the end of the world. They said they're booked.
interview.lucifertotem.q.labyrinth=Who is the Lady at the heart of the Labyrinth?
interview.lucifertotem.a.labyrinth.1=Every maze has someone in the middle who isn't lost.
interview.lucifertotem.a.labyrinth.2=Keep hold of the red thread and you'll find out which of you that is.
interview.lucifertotem.q.hydra=How do you kill a Hydra?
interview.lucifertotem.a.hydra.1=Cut off a head and two grow back. Burn the stump and none do.
interview.lucifertotem.a.hydra.2=A lot of stories work like that, if you think about it.
interview.lucifertotem.q.hail=Why does everyone say "Hail Satan"?
interview.lucifertotem.a.hail.1=It's a good way to sign off. It's polite and it gets your attention.
interview.lucifertotem.a.hail.2=The Doctor started it. I'm only answering my mail.
