# ---- 1.3.2: Dionysus and the Crown of Thorns
tile.lucifertotem.dionysus_mask.name=Mask of Dionysus
tooltip.lucifertotem.dionysus_mask.1=A carved wooden face of the god who arrives. Hangs on any wall.
tooltip.lucifertotem.dionysus_mask.2=The old ones on the fountains sometimes hide a Crown of Thorns.
entity.lucifertotem.dionysus.name=Dionysus
tile.lucifertotem.dionysus_icon.name=Purple-Splashed Dionysus
tile.lucifertotem.dionysus_statue.name=Dionysus Statue
tooltip.lucifertotem.dionysus_statue.1=Long hair, a beard, a white robe with a red sash, and wine all over him.
tooltip.lucifertotem.dionysus_statue.2=Set him on a T of four logs (like an iron golem) and he comes to life.
item.lucifertotem.crown_of_thorns.name=Crown of Thorns
tooltip.lucifertotem.crown_of_thorns.1=In the Lightfall its creatures let you pass, until you strike one.
tooltip.lucifertotem.crown_of_thorns.2=The Dipsas does not care. Its bite on a crowned head goes PURPLE.
tooltip.lucifertotem.crown_of_thorns.3=Sneak + use to wear it over any helmet; sneak + right-click a block, empty-handed, to take it off.
msg.lucifertotem.crown_on=You settle the Crown of Thorns over your head. The Lightfall goes quiet around you.
msg.lucifertotem.crown_off=You lift the Crown of Thorns off, carefully.
msg.lucifertotem.crown_dipsas=The Dipsas does not care about your crown. Everything goes PURPLE.
msg.lucifertotem.dionysus_wakes=The statue blinks, smiles, and steps down. Dionysus has arrived. (He always does.)
msg.lucifertotem.dionysus_sits=Dionysus sits down and waits, like a patient host.
msg.lucifertotem.dionysus_follows=Dionysus gets up to follow you.
msg.lucifertotem.dionysus_wine=He taps the bottle. It is finished... fermenting. Bacchic Wine!
msg.lucifertotem.dionysus_no_miracle=Dionysus shrugs. Not today.
advancements.lucifertotem.xoanon.title=The God Who Arrives
advancements.lucifertotem.xoanon.description=Bring Dionysus to life: four logs in a T, his statue on top
advancements.lucifertotem.it_is_finished.title=It Is Finished... Fermenting
